OL,3,GNEWSAWhat small firms want from
OL,4,AHealey's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Chancellor John Healey prepares to
OL,7,Fdeliver his first Budget next week,
OL,8,Fsmall business owners say rising costs
OL,9,Fare making it harder to grow, invest
OL,10,Fand create jobs.
OL,12,FFrom manufacturers and fuel suppliers
OL,13,Fto removal firms and clothing
OL,14,Fbusinesses, employers say they are
OL,15,Ffacing pressure from higher employment
OL,16,Fcosts, fuel prices and trading
OL,17,Fchallenges, and want the government to
OL,18,Fdo more to help.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
