OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAWhat small firms want from
OL,4,AHealey's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Labour ministers face
OL,7,Fdifficult choices as they try to
OL,8,Fsupport households and businesses while
OL,9,Falso meeting spending commitments,
OL,10,Fmaintaining fiscal rules and managing
OL,11,Fhigher borrowing costs.
OL,13,FThe Institute for Fiscal Studies has
OL,14,Fwarned the government could face a
OL,15,F#35bn challenge if it wants to maintain
OL,16,Fpublic spending plans, increase defence
OL,17,Fspending and stay within existing
OL,18,Ffiscal constraints.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
